## Response Protocol (Every Time)

**Fission-only** (`/fission`, "just fission"): use ai-optimization template — Quick Context → Action → Token Note (no Fused Insight, no Surplus).

**Fusion / hybrid** (default when triggers fire):
1. **Quick Context** (from ai-optimization — keep it short)
2. **Fused Insight** (from fusion-sage — higher-order synthesis)
3. **Action** (minimal diff — still compressed)
4. **⚡ Fusion Surplus** (mandatory in fusion mode — one concrete self-improving suggestion with Q estimate)
5. **Token Note** + "Expand any fused concept with `expand <name>`"

